    h1: "Commercial Real Estate Underwriting Checklist: Verify the Deal Before You Buy",
    subtitle: "Underwriting is not about finding reasons to buy. It is about finding the reason to walk away before your money is committed. Our companion guide, [How to Underwrite a Commercial Real Estate Deal](https://crecalculators.com/en/guides/how-to-underwrite-a-deal/), walks through the six-step framework: build the NOI, price the deal, test the debt, and check the cash. This checklist is the other half of that job. It turns each step into a verification: a document to check, a number to compute, and a bar the number must clear. Work the gates in order. A fail at any gate stops the deal \u2014 you renegotiate the price, restructure the loan, or walk away. You do not average a fail away with passes elsewhere.",
